PageObjectModel(POM):
 --> design pattern,where every webpages is represented as one Java class.

 eg:https://www.saucedemo.com/
 Pages:
    Login Page --> enter username, password and click on login button --> LoginPage.java --> locators+behaviours
    Product Page --> Products label verification  --> Product.java --> locators+behaviours
 tests:
    oneTestSuite --> TC1,TC2,TC3...

 Real life:
 TV Remote ---> Needs TV -->Remote doesnt create TV --> Remote controls TV
 SauceTest:
 LoginPage ---> Needs driver ---> Doesnt create driver -->uses the driver


 PageFactory
 --> it is a support class provided by selenium that helps to initialize web elements automatically
     using annotations like "@FindBy"